<title>UK: British Foreign Secretary to visit Washington.</title>
<headline>British Foreign Secretary to visit Washington.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Foreign Secretary Malcolm Rifkind will visit Washington on Sunday and Monday, meeting Secretary of State Madeleine Albright and Defence Secretary William Cohen, the Foreign Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>On Monday Rifkind will also make a speech on the future of NATO at the Carnegie Endowment for International Peace, a statement said.</p>
<p>Rifkind last went to Washington at the end of May last year.</p>
</text>
